      "desc_en": "Elastic Security — Elastic's unified SIEM, XDR, endpoint, and cloud-security solution. It uses Elasticsearch for storage and search, Kibana for investigations, and Elastic Agent/Defend for endpoint telemetry and response.",
      "desc_ru": "Elastic Security — единое решение Elastic для SIEM, XDR, endpoint и cloud security. Оно использует Elasticsearch для хранения и поиска, Kibana для расследований и Elastic Agent/Defend для endpoint telemetry и response.",
      "usage_en": "Choose a deployment model, data streams, and ECS mappings; deploy Elastic Agent or third-party integrations; then configure detection rules, cases, and response actions. Validate performance against representative ingestion before enabling broad detections. Minimum operating loop: defined scope → trusted data source → pinned configuration → verifiable result → action owner → retest. Blocking gates and automated response require predefined severity, confidence, exceptions, approval, and rollback.",
